1
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,670
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:12,210
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,380
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:18,970
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,950
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,370
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,330
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,860
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,350
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,210
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,200
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,810
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,260
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:42,460
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,460
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:49,880
Iron Leopard didn't suspect you?

17
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:51,160
No.

18
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:56,200
You're sure this is the treasure map?

19
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:57,480
It is.

20
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:02,040
But the Lu family's hidden treasure
is marked on the other half.

21
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,440
Fancheng is huge.

22
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:09,480
Knowing it's not on this half

23
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,640
gets us nowhere.

24
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,520
You're sure that girl wasn't exposed?

25
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:17,120
Could Iron Leopard be using her
to lure us out?

26
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,440
If that were true,

27
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,280
once this is over,

28
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,640
Iron Leopard wouldn't let her live.

29
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:31,600
Then Lu Shaoyun must've
given himself away somehow.

30
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:33,560
He was too impatient.

31
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:35,280
And incompetent.

32
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,400
But his incompetence is exactly

33
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:39,800
why we chose to side with him,

34
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:40,360
isn't it?

35
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:44,360
After all,
with Iron Leopard out of power,

36
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:47,160
all Lu Shaoyun cares about
is money and women.

37
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,520
As for the army,

38
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,480
he wouldn't go near it.

39
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:55,680
That would be our chance
to overhaul the Lu Army.

40
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,360
But now,

41
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:01,520
things haven't gone
the way we planned.

42
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,440
We tried to kill with a borrowed blade.

43
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,800
Now the blade is gone,

44
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,520
but the target remains.

45
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:12,120
We'll have to rethink our plans.

46
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,640
Look on the bright side.

47
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:19,040
At least the treasure map

48
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,680
is still with that girl.

49
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:28,260
=Episode 9=

50
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,680
Here.

51
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,040
Take this money.

52
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,000
Learn a trade,

53
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,520
and find somewhere safe to settle down.

54
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,360
(Yunshang Western Clothing)
You...

55
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,760
(Yunshang Western Clothing)
You don't blame me for exposing you?

56
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,680
Your life was hanging by a thread.

57
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,280
Anyone could be bought
in your situation.

58
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,360
(Yunshang Western Clothing)

59
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,480
And you.

60
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,920
Leave Fancheng.

61
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:50,000
Never come back.

62
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,600
Ms. Lu.

63
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,640
I'll never forget your kindness.

64
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,840
I'm not really Ms. Lu.

65
00:02:57,960 --> 00:03:00,640
I've had a hard life, just like you.

66
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:04,680
(Yunshang Western Clothing)

67
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,480
Go. Hurry.

68
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,800
Stay safe.

69
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:52,940
(100 taels)

70
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,560
(Why?)

71
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,000
(Why did Lin Kefu's biological father)

72
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,320
(have to be a bloodthirsty monster?)

73
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:10,680
(Why?)

74
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,720
Governor.

75
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,040
These are all the young master's ledgers
from the past few years.

76
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,440
That ungrateful son.

77
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,360
I gave him so much,

78
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,880
and it was never enough.

79
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,560
Why?

80
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,720
Why did you have to kill them?

81
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:40,680
They were innocent.

82
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:41,920
They only accused me

83
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,440
because Lady Feng manipulated them.

84
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,520
They won't talk once they're out.

85
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:51,640
Didn't you want to be my daughter?

86
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:54,680
Today, I'll teach you
what that really means!

87
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,160
I don't care

88
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,680
whether they were innocent,

89
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,520
whether they'd talk,

90
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,160
or whether they could.

91
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,880
I care about what benefits me

92
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:07,840
and what can hurt me.

93
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,440
Remember this.

94
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,840
Only the dead stay silent.

95
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,680
You'd better learn.

96
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,040
I understand.

97
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:26,360
These are records from the firms
that traitor managed.

98
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,080
Take them and look them over.

99
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,880
Ask me if you have any questions.

100
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,160
Go out!

101
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,360
Okay.

102
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:36,320
(Gentle Breezes Bring Harmony)
(This is my fault.)

103
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,240
(I underestimated Lu Zhentian's
cruelty.)

104
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,760
(I got Lili and Rong killed
for nothing.)

105
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,880
(Maybe...)

106
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:46,040
(the one I should learn from
is He Jingchen.)

107
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:48,400
(I need to learn to hide my emotions)

108
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:50,600
(and never let Lu Zhentian read me.)

109
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,120
He Jingchen.

110
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,840
What are you doing here?

111
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,080
So this is where

112
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,560
you usually pay your respects to her.

113
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,040
What gives you the right
to barge into my room

114
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,760
and touch my things?

115
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,200
An assassin entered
the Governor's Residence.

116
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,760
The young master was killed.

117
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:24,760
On the governor's orders,

118
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,200
I'm searching the entire residence.

119
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,240
Adjutant He, you can lie

120
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,440
without batting an eye.

121
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,200
Right back at you.

122
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,200
You once said you envied her

123
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,760
and wanted to replace her
as head magician.

124
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:41,360
Is this what you call envy?

125
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,440
I should've realized sooner.

126
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,240
You agreed to be our puppet

127
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,520
so you could avenge her.

128
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:51,720
You've been playing one game openly
and another in secret.

129
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,840
That's hardly how partners act.

130
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,320
You're one to talk.

131
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:57,480
(Jinhai Chamber of Commerce)
Did I kill Lu Shaoyun?

132
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,480
You were the one

133
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:01,640
who betrayed your ally
when it mattered most.

134
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:03,680
He wasn't my ally.

135
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,320
He never was.

136
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,040
Of course.

137
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,920
He was just a means to an end.

138
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,280
I thought

139
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,880
you'd only chosen to rely on Lu Shaoyun

140
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,240
to get what you wanted.

141
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,840
Clearly, I underestimated you.

142
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,200
You want to replace Lu Shaoyun,

143
00:07:19,200 --> 00:07:20,000
even Lu Zhentian.

144
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,520
You want the whole Governor's Residence.

145
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:23,960
You're not afraid of me anymore?

146
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,200
I am.

147
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:28,000
Because someone like you

148
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,640
would never see anyone as a true ally.

149
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,560
At any moment, I could end up

150
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,600
sacrificed just like Lu Shaoyun.

151
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,120
Maybe you won't.

152
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,280
After all, you're smarter than he was.

153
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,640
You even got your hands
on the treasure map.

154
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,600
(Lu Chamber of Commerce)
What are you waiting for?

155
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,680
Hand it over.

156
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,160
I gave it back to Lu Zhentian.

157
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:53,980
(Lu Chamber of Commerce)

158
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,600
What?

159
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:58,960
Do you really think I'm
that easy to fool?

160
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,600
You only returned half.

161
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,760
So how did you explain that
to your dear father?

162
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:10,560
I told him

163
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,760
Lu Shaoyun found out
he'd given me the treasure map,

164
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,840
he came to take it from me,

165
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,000
and it got torn by accident
in the struggle.

166
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,800
I'm not lying to you.

167
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,280
(Lu Chamber of Commerce)
It's all because your plan failed.

168
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:22,960
(Lu Chamber of Commerce)
Lu Zhentian survived,

169
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,200
(Lu Chamber of Commerce)
and this whole mess happened.

170
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,560
I had no choice.

171
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,520
I had to prove my innocence
to him first.

172
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:32,900
(Lu Chamber of Commerce)

173
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,600
I have to admit,

174
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:40,320
you know how to switch sides
when it suits you.

175
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,880
You're smarter than I thought.

176
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,000
Even if one day

177
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:52,280
Lu Zhentian discovers
you're an impostor,

178
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,000
you may still become someone

179
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:57,440
he trusts more than his own daughter.

180
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,360
I think

181
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,360
our partnership can continue.

182
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:04,960
Your mission stays the same.

183
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,840
I'll give you more when it's done.

184
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,880
Tell me.

185
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,920
What else do you want besides money?

186
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:16,000
I'll have to think about that.

187
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:19,240
But I'm tired right now.

188
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,800
I need to rest.

189
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:22,560
All right.

190
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,360
(She came here...)

191
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,960
(Was it more to avenge Lin Kefu,)

192
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:53,200
(or more for wealth and status?)

193
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,020
♪The mist steals away the colors♪

194
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:56,760
♪Trying to make the act seem profound♪

195
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:57,600
Kefu.

196
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:00,120
Everyone here is a monster.

197
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:04,120
♪Now I have to choose alone♪

198
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,920
Lu Shaoyun is dead.

199
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,000
I avenged you.

200
00:10:08,370 --> 00:10:10,210
♪Pretense puts on a show♪

201
00:10:10,210 --> 00:10:12,220
♪Indulgence joins the game♪

202
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:14,520
♪What do the innocent have to hide?♪

203
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,680
Just wait a little longer.

204
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,360
I'll take you away soon.

205
00:10:21,190 --> 00:10:23,210
♪A place♪

206
00:10:44,500 --> 00:10:48,830
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

207
00:10:50,490 --> 00:10:53,830
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

208
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:56,450
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

209
00:10:57,970 --> 00:10:59,530
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

210
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:03,650
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

211
00:11:04,210 --> 00:11:09,610
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

212
00:11:11,210 --> 00:11:14,530
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

213
00:11:14,530 --> 00:11:17,890
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

214
00:11:17,890 --> 00:11:20,450
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

215
00:11:20,450 --> 00:11:23,450
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

216
00:11:23,730 --> 00:11:29,970
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

217
00:11:30,450 --> 00:11:33,770
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

218
00:11:33,770 --> 00:11:37,010
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

219
00:11:37,010 --> 00:11:43,770
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

220
00:11:43,770 --> 00:11:47,050
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

221
00:11:47,050 --> 00:11:50,490
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

222
00:11:50,490 --> 00:11:52,610
♪Boundless♪
